            "id": 19,
            "type": "markdown",
            "source": "## Step 8 — Confirm the answers moved too\n\nA retrieval fix is only real if the answer report agrees. Re-run the answer evaluation on\nthe improved index, still with the offline generator, and compare the two scorecards."
